      "dc:source": "my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018.pdf, p.9",
      "values:originalText": "After “If there is no person who the System Operator is satisfied has\nparental responsibility for a healthcare recipient aged under 18,”, insert\n“or the only such persons are covered by subsection (1A),”.",
      "skos:definition": "After “If there is no person who the System Operator is satisfied has\nparental responsibility for a healthcare recipient aged under 18,”, insert\n“or the only such persons are covered by subsection (1A),”.",
