      },
      "dc:source": "my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018.pdf, p.9",
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the subsection, substitute:\nHealthcare recipients aged between 14 and 17\n\n(3) For the purposes of this Act, a person is the authorised\nrepresentative of a healthcare recipient aged between 14 and 17\nyears if the healthcare recipient, by written notice given to the\nSystem Operator in the approved form, nominates the person to be\nhis or her authorised representative.",
      "skos:definition": "Repeal the subsection, substitute:\nHealthcare recipients aged between 14 and 17\n\n(3) For the purposes of this Act, a person is the authorised\nrepresentative of a healthcare recipient aged between 14 and 17\nyears if the healthcare recipient, by written notice given to the\nSystem Operator in the approved form, nominates the person to be\nhis or her authorised representative.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018-sch-1-sec-1da-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018-sch-1-sec-1da-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "f3fb9659f2b90078cd260f633f0e8b05c365e65361bb4071816f4d528056c3b7",
      "skos:note": "Authorise a person to act on behalf of a healthcare recipient aged 14-17."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018#sch-1-sec-1da",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "1DA Subsection 6(3)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 9,
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the subsection, substitute:\nHealthcare recipients aged between 14 and 17\n\n(3) For the purposes of this Act, a person is the authorised\nrepresentative of a healthcare recipient aged between 14 and 17\nyears if the healthcare recipient, by written notice given to the\nSystem Operator in the approved form, nominates the person to be\nhis or her authorised representative."
    },
