      },
      "dc:source": "my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018.pdf, p.9",
      "values:originalText": "The System Operator’s function under paragraph 15(ma) does not\ninclude providing de-identified data to a private health insurer\n(within the meaning of the Private Health Insurance Act 2007) or\nany other insurer.",
      "skos:definition": "The System Operator’s function under paragraph 15(ma) does not\ninclude providing de-identified data to a private health insurer\n(within the meaning of the Private Health Insurance Act 2007) or\nany other insurer.",
      "cml:asserts": [
