      "dc:source": "my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018.pdf, p.10",
      "values:originalText": "Add:\n\n; or (iii) if, under subsection (3), the record is required to be destroyed\nbecause of the cancellation of registration of the healthcare\nrecipient—when the System Operator is required to destroy\nthe record under subsection (4).",
      "skos:definition": "Add:\n\n; or (iii) if, under subsection (3), the record is required to be destroyed\nbecause of the cancellation of registration of the healthcare\nrecipient—when the System Operator is required to destroy\nthe record under subsection (4).",
