    {
      "@id": "concept:my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018-sch-1-sec-6-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "6(5) At the end of section 17",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018#sch-1-sec-6-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018.pdf, p.10",
      "values:originalText": "(5) To avoid doubt, if the System Operator is required under\nsubsection (3) to destroy a record that includes health information,\nthe System Operator must also destroy the following:\n\n(a) any copy of the record;\n\n(b) any previous version of the record;\n\n(c) any back-up version of the record.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) To avoid doubt, if the System Operator is required under\nsubsection (3) to destroy a record that includes health information,\nthe System Operator must also destroy the following:\n\n(a) any copy of the record;\n\n(b) any previous version of the record;\n\n(c) any back-up version of the record.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018-sch-1-sec-6"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018-sch-1-sec-6-ss-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018-sch-1-sec-6-ss-5-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018-sch-1-sec-6-ss-5-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "fba4c5839eed01dd0f40efd85b3bc87126145a173f899055467b9de110dd6713",
      "skos:note": "Destroy all copies, versions, and back-ups of health records."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018#sch-1-sec-6-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "6(5) At the end of section 17",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 10,
      "values:originalText": "(5) To avoid doubt, if the System Operator is required under\nsubsection (3) to destroy a record that includes health information,\nthe System Operator must also destroy the following:\n\n(a) any copy of the record;\n\n(b) any previous version of the record;\n\n(c) any back-up version of the record."
    },
