      "dc:source": "my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018.pdf, p.13",
      "values:originalText": "(2) Except as mentioned in subsection (1) or in accordance with a law\ncovered by subsection 65(3), a participant in the My Health Record\nsystem, or a healthcare recipient, cannot be required to disclose\nhealth information included in a healthcare recipient’s My Health\nRecord to a designated entity.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) Except as mentioned in subsection (1) or in accordance with a law\ncovered by subsection 65(3), a participant in the My Health Record\nsystem, or a healthcare recipient, cannot be required to disclose\nhealth information included in a healthcare recipient’s My Health\nRecord to a designated entity.",
