    {
      "@id": "concept:my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018-sch-1-sec-69a-ss-8",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "69A(8) Disclosure to designated entity under order by judicial officer",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018#sch-1-sec-69a-ss-8"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018.pdf, p.13",
      "values:originalText": "(8) The judicial officer must not make the order unless the designated\nentity or some other person has given the judicial officer, either\norally or by affidavit, such further information (if any) as the\njudicial officer requires concerning the grounds on which the order\nis being sought.",
      "skos:definition": "(8) The judicial officer must not make the order unless the designated\nentity or some other person has given the judicial officer, either\norally or by affidavit, such further information (if any) as the\njudicial officer requires concerning the grounds on which the order\nis being sought.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018-sch-1-sec-69a"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018-sch-1-sec-69a-ss-8-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018-sch-1-sec-69a-ss-8-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "f11bd231c620317b30088fbd983a882ebbdb1fdaf0b15327b16172e4fe563aec",
      "skos:note": "Must provide further information to judicial officer before making order.",
      "dc:description": "Yes"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018#sch-1-sec-69a-ss-8",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "69A(8) Disclosure to designated entity under order by judicial officer",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 13,
      "values:originalText": "(8) The judicial officer must not make the order unless the designated\nentity or some other person has given the judicial officer, either\norally or by affidavit, such further information (if any) as the\njudicial officer requires concerning the grounds on which the order\nis being sought."
    },
