        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018-sch-1-sec-69b-ss-7-logic-linearlogic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "abeed59c6b2231f35296b671a80061f8879396eb524d7eeb1ff584878fcbc631",
      "skos:note": "Protection and immunity for judicial officers performing functions under section 69A"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018#sch-1-sec-69b-ss-7",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "69B(7) Judicial officers for orders under section 69A",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 15,
      "values:originalText": "(7) A judicial officer performing a function conferred by section 69A\nhas the same protection and immunity as if the judicial officer were\nperforming the function:\n\n(a) as the court of which the judicial officer is a member; or\n\n(b) as a member of the court of which the judicial officer is a\nmember."
    },
