      "values:originalText": "Add:\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\n\nNo. 154, 2018\nMy Health Records Amendment (Strengthening Privacy) Act 2018\n\nSubdivision C—Unauthorised use of information included in a\nhealthcare recipient’s My Health Record for\nprohibited purpose",
