    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018#sch-1-sec-70a-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "70A(3) Definition of prohibited purpose",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 17,
      "values:originalText": "(3) To avoid doubt, use of information is not for a prohibited purpose\nif the use is solely for:\n\n(a) the purpose of providing healthcare to the healthcare\nrecipient; or\n\n(b) purposes relating to the provision of indemnity cover for a\nhealthcare provider."
    },
