      "dc:source": "my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018.pdf, p.18",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Despite Subdivisions A and B, a person is not authorised under this\nDivision to use health information included in a registered\nhealthcare recipient’s My Health Record for a prohibited purpose.\n\n(2) Subsection (1) does not apply if the person is the healthcare\nrecipient, but does apply if the person is the nominated\nrepresentative of the healthcare recipient (despite subsection 7(2)).",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Despite Subdivisions A and B, a person is not authorised under this\nDivision to use health information included in a registered\nhealthcare recipient’s My Health Record for a prohibited purpose.\n\n(2) Subsection (1) does not apply if the person is the healthcare\nrecipient, but does apply if the person is the nominated\nrepresentative of the healthcare recipient (despite subsection 7(2)).",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018-sch-1-sec-70b-ss-1"
        },
        {
