        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "ffc500f063a6deb778b1c233e4c8bbf029221c3904f9178225a5f01a99811314"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018#sch-1-sec-70b",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "70B Use for prohibited purpose is unauthorised",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 18,
      "values:originalText": "(1) Despite Subdivisions A and B, a person is not authorised under this\nDivision to use health information included in a registered\nhealthcare recipient’s My Health Record for a prohibited purpose.\n\n(2) Subsection (1) does not apply if the person is the healthcare\nrecipient, but does apply if the person is the nominated\nrepresentative of the healthcare recipient (despite subsection 7(2))."
    },
