      "values:originalText": "Repeal the paragraph, substitute:\n\n(b) the period is the period beginning on the day on which this\nPart commences and ending on 31 January 2019.\n\nSchedule 2  Amendments commencing on Proclamation\n\nMy Health Records Amendment (Strengthening Privacy) Act 2018\nNo. 154, 2018",
      "skos:definition": "Repeal the paragraph, substitute:\n\n(b) the period is the period beginning on the day on which this\nPart commences and ending on 31 January 2019.\n\nSchedule 2  Amendments commencing on Proclamation\n\nMy Health Records Amendment (Strengthening Privacy) Act 2018\nNo. 154, 2018",
