    {
      "@id": "concept:my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018-sch-2-sec-82",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "82 Data Governance Board",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018#sch-2-sec-82"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018.pdf, p.23",
      "values:originalText": "The Data Governance Board is established by this section.\n\nSchedule 2  Amendments commencing on Proclamation\n\nMy Health Records Amendment (Strengthening Privacy) Act 2018\nNo. 154, 2018",
      "skos:definition": "The Data Governance Board is established by this section.\n\nSchedule 2  Amendments commencing on Proclamation\n\nMy Health Records Amendment (Strengthening Privacy) Act 2018\nNo. 154, 2018",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018-sch-2-sec-82-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "6565155dad11b85353539f07e34eaae2c6f41d207bb9dd901a21c85a6fae7fb4",
      "skos:note": "Establishes Data Governance Board"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018#sch-2-sec-82",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "82 Data Governance Board",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 23,
      "values:originalText": "The Data Governance Board is established by this section.\n\nSchedule 2  Amendments commencing on Proclamation\n\nMy Health Records Amendment (Strengthening Privacy) Act 2018\nNo. 154, 2018"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018-sch-2-sec-82-norm",
      "@type": "values:Undertaking",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018-sch-2-sec-82"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018-sch-2-sec-83",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "83 Functions of the Board",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018#sch-2-sec-83"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018.pdf, p.24",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The functions of the Data Governance Board are:\n\n(a) to oversee the operation of the framework prescribed by My\nHealth Records Rules made for the purposes of\nsubsection 109(7A), including by:\n\n(i) assessing applications for the collection, use or\ndisclosure of de-identified data and health information\nfor research or public health purposes; and\n\n(ii) guiding and directing the System Operator in the\nperformance of its function under paragraph 15(ma)\n(preparing and providing de-identified data and health\ninformation); and\n\n(iii) taking steps to ensure the ongoing protection of\nde-identified data and health information used by, or\ndisclosed to, persons for research or public health\npurposes and that the data and information is being used\nand disclosed only for those purposes; and\n\n(b) any other functions conferred on the Board by this Act or the\nMy Health Records Rules.\n\n(2) The Board does not have any functions, and must not perform any\nrole, in relation to the day-to-day operation of the My Health\nRecord system.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The functions of the Data Governance Board are:\n\n(a) to oversee the operation of the framework prescribed by My\nHealth Records Rules made for the purposes of\nsubsection 109(7A), including by:\n\n(i) assessing applications for the collection, use or\ndisclosure of de-identified data and health information\nfor research or public health purposes; and\n\n(ii) guiding and directing the System Operator in the\nperformance of its function under paragraph 15(ma)\n(preparing and providing de-identified data and health\ninformation); and\n\n(iii) taking steps to ensure the ongoing protection of\nde-identified data and health information used by, or\ndisclosed to, persons for research or public health\npurposes and that the data and information is being used\nand disclosed only for those purposes; and\n\n(b) any other functions conferred on the Board by this Act or the\nMy Health Records Rules.\n\n(2) The Board does not have any functions, and must not perform any\nrole, in relation to the day-to-day operation of the My Health\nRecord system.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018-sch-2-sec-83-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018-sch-2-sec-83-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "14c18ff3590900567a7e47af2b18acd43d949a2bd4d672a06e7a38da234ff98a"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018#sch-2-sec-83",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "83 Functions of the Board",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 24,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The functions of the Data Governance Board are:\n\n(a) to oversee the operation of the framework prescribed by My\nHealth Records Rules made for the purposes of\nsubsection 109(7A), including by:\n\n(i) assessing applications for the collection, use or\ndisclosure of de-identified data and health information\nfor research or public health purposes; and\n\n(ii) guiding and directing the System Operator in the\nperformance of its function under paragraph 15(ma)\n(preparing and providing de-identified data and health\ninformation); and\n\n(iii) taking steps to ensure the ongoing protection of\nde-identified data and health information used by, or\ndisclosed to, persons for research or public health\npurposes and that the data and information is being used\nand disclosed only for those purposes; and\n\n(b) any other functions conferred on the Board by this Act or the\nMy Health Records Rules.\n\n(2) The Board does not have any functions, and must not perform any\nrole, in relation to the day-to-day operation of the My Health\nRecord system."
    },
