      },
      "dc:source": "my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018.pdf, p.24",
      "values:originalText": "The Data Governance Board consists of the following members:\n\n(a) the Chair of the Data Governance Board;\n\n(b) the Deputy Chair of the Data Governance Board;\n\n(c) at least 7, and no more than 10, other members.",
      "skos:definition": "The Data Governance Board consists of the following members:\n\n(a) the Chair of the Data Governance Board;\n\n(b) the Deputy Chair of the Data Governance Board;\n\n(c) at least 7, and no more than 10, other members.",
