      },
      "dc:source": "my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018.pdf, p.24",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Members are to be appointed by the Minister by written\ninstrument, on a part-time basis.\n\n(2) The Minister must appoint one member to be the Chair and another\nmember to be the Deputy Chair.\n\nAmendments commencing on Proclamation  Schedule 2\n\nNo. 154, 2018\nMy Health Records Amendment (Strengthening Privacy) Act 2018",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Members are to be appointed by the Minister by written\ninstrument, on a part-time basis.\n\n(2) The Minister must appoint one member to be the Chair and another\nmember to be the Deputy Chair.\n\nAmendments commencing on Proclamation  Schedule 2\n\nNo. 154, 2018\nMy Health Records Amendment (Strengthening Privacy) Act 2018",
