    {
      "@id": "concept:my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018-sch-2-sec-86-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "86(2) Qualifications and experience",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018#sch-2-sec-86-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018.pdf, p.25",
      "values:originalText": "(2) A person (including a person appointed in accordance with\nsubsection (1)) is not eligible for appointment as a member of the\nData Governance Board unless the person has skills or experience\nin, or knowledge of, one or more of the following fields:\n\n(a) population health and epidemiology;\n\n(b) medical or health research;\n\n(c) health services delivery;\n\n(d) technology;\n\n(e) data science;\n\n(f) data governance;\n\n(g) privacy;\n\n(h) consumer advocacy.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) A person (including a person appointed in accordance with\nsubsection (1)) is not eligible for appointment as a member of the\nData Governance Board unless the person has skills or experience\nin, or knowledge of, one or more of the following fields:\n\n(a) population health and epidemiology;\n\n(b) medical or health research;\n\n(c) health services delivery;\n\n(d) technology;\n\n(e) data science;\n\n(f) data governance;\n\n(g) privacy;\n\n(h) consumer advocacy.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018-sch-2-sec-86"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018-sch-2-sec-86-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018-sch-2-sec-86-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "27d928e7d983b838cf8dc697b2b513dd40453fb2913db25df0eef4d880637412",
      "skos:note": "Eligibility requirements for Data Governance Board members"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018#sch-2-sec-86-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "86(2) Qualifications and experience",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 25,
      "values:originalText": "(2) A person (including a person appointed in accordance with\nsubsection (1)) is not eligible for appointment as a member of the\nData Governance Board unless the person has skills or experience\nin, or knowledge of, one or more of the following fields:\n\n(a) population health and epidemiology;\n\n(b) medical or health research;\n\n(c) health services delivery;\n\n(d) technology;\n\n(e) data science;\n\n(f) data governance;\n\n(g) privacy;\n\n(h) consumer advocacy."
    },
