      "cof:title": "88 Term of appointment and other terms and conditions",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 26,
      "values:originalText": "(1) A member of the Data Governance Board holds office for the\nperiod specified in the instrument of appointment. The period must\nnot exceed 5 years.\n\n(2) A member of the Data Governance Board holds office on the terms\nand conditions (if any) in relation to matters not covered by this\nPart that are determined by the Minister."
    },
