      "cml:integrityHash": "313cc887008239b19da6ee40331005d3cb25b643bbf00d10fced2600c9fec708"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018#sch-2-sec-90",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "90 Resignation",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 26,
      "values:originalText": "(1) A member of the Data Governance Board may resign the\nmember’s appointment by giving the Minister a written\nresignation.\n\nAmendments commencing on Proclamation  Schedule 2\n\nNo. 154, 2018\nMy Health Records Amendment (Strengthening Privacy) Act 2018\n\n(2) The resignation takes effect on the day it is received by the\nMinister or, if a later day is specified in the resignation, on that\nlater day."
    },
