      "values:originalText": "The Minister may grant leave of absence to any member of the\nData Governance Board on the terms and conditions that the\nMinister determines.\n\nSchedule 2  Amendments commencing on Proclamation\n\nMy Health Records Amendment (Strengthening Privacy) Act 2018\nNo. 154, 2018",
