      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 29,
      "values:originalText": "(1) A question arising at a meeting of the Data Governance Board is to\nbe determined by a majority of the votes of the members of the\nBoard present and voting.\n\n(2) The person presiding at a meeting of the Board has a deliberative\nvote and, if the votes are equal, a casting vote."
    },
