      "values:originalText": "(2) If rules made for the purposes of subsection 109(7A) require the\nData Governance Board to take steps to ensure that de-identified\ndata and health information disclosed to persons for research or\npublic health purposes is being used only for those purposes, the\nSystem Operator must not take any steps of its own to ensure that\nthe data and information is being used only for those purposes.",
