    {
      "@id": "concept:my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018-sch-2-sec-96h",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "96H Annual report",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018#sch-2-sec-96h"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018.pdf, p.32",
      "values:originalText": "(1) As soon as practicable after the end of each financial year, the Data\nGovernance Board must prepare and give a report to the Minister,\nfor presentation to the Parliament, on the Board’s activities during\nthe financial year.\nNote:\nSee also section 34C of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901, which\ncontains extra rules about annual reports.\n\n(2) A report on the Department’s activities given under section 46 of\nthe Public Governance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013\ndoes not need to include a report on the activities of the Board.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) As soon as practicable after the end of each financial year, the Data\nGovernance Board must prepare and give a report to the Minister,\nfor presentation to the Parliament, on the Board’s activities during\nthe financial year.\nNote:\nSee also section 34C of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901, which\ncontains extra rules about annual reports.\n\n(2) A report on the Department’s activities given under section 46 of\nthe Public Governance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013\ndoes not need to include a report on the activities of the Board.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018-sch-2-sec-96h-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018-sch-2-sec-96h-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "8a10b71767d21a465d231ac42282dc4007d8dfcbe36829845db5efc917fb97b8"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018#sch-2-sec-96h",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "96H Annual report",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 32,
      "values:originalText": "(1) As soon as practicable after the end of each financial year, the Data\nGovernance Board must prepare and give a report to the Minister,\nfor presentation to the Parliament, on the Board’s activities during\nthe financial year.\nNote:\nSee also section 34C of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901, which\ncontains extra rules about annual reports.\n\n(2) A report on the Department’s activities given under section 46 of\nthe Public Governance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013\ndoes not need to include a report on the activities of the Board."
    },
