      },
      "dc:source": "my-health-records-amendment-strengthening-privacy-act-2018.pdf, p.32",
      "values:originalText": "For the purposes of paragraph (a) of the definition of Department\nof State in section 8 of the Public Governance, Performance and\nAccountability Act 2013, the Data Governance Board is prescribed\nin relation to the Department.",
      "skos:definition": "For the purposes of paragraph (a) of the definition of Department\nof State in section 8 of the Public Governance, Performance and\nAccountability Act 2013, the Data Governance Board is prescribed\nin relation to the Department.",
